{"id":"en_10-000-a-day-museum-night-shift","title":"$10,000 a Day: Museum Night Shift","titleEn":"$10,000 a Day: Museum Night Shift","description":"Joseph Amos, a mortician struggling financially, accepts a lucrative overnight security position at the enigmatic Blackwood Museum. What he finds there is far from ordinary: the artifacts on display serve as prisons for dangerous demons. When he repairs a statue of a Kraken and thereby averts a catastrophic S-rank event, Joseph is recruited by the Church's exorcists. Together they work to unravel the mysteries hidden within the museum, while Joseph also contends with his own developing abilities. Dramzio is one place where this series can be followed.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/dollar10000-a-day-museum-night-shift/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/dollar10000-a-day-museum-night-shift/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Mind-Bending","Modern","Mystery","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7diu1k/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_10-000-a-day-museum-night-shift_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7diu1k/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_10-000-a-day-museum-night-shift_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7diu1k/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_10-000-a-day-museum-night-shift_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7diu1k/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_10-000-a-day-museum-night-shift_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sourc